# GitHub Actions CI 工作流（样例）

> 说明：GitHub 限制——用 OAuth App token（如 `gh auth login` 生成的 `gho_` token）
> 推送 `.github/workflows/` 目录需要额外的 `workflow` 权限。
> 如果你的 token 缺这个权限，请先执行下面命令刷新权限，再把本文件
> 复制为 `.github/workflows/ci.yml` 并推送即可启用 CI：

```bash
gh auth refresh -s workflow
mkdir -p .github/workflows
cp docs/ci-workflow.yml.sample .github/workflows/ci.yml
git add .github/workflows/ci.yml && git commit -m "ci: 启用 GitHub Actions" && git push
```

以下为工作流内容（`name: CI` 之后）：

```yaml
name: CI

on:
  push:
    branches: [main]
  pull_request:
    branches: [main]

jobs:
  backend:
    name: 后端测试
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    defaults:
      run:
        working-directory: backend
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: actions/setup-python@v5
        with:
          python-version: "3.12"
          cache: pip
          cache-dependency-path: backend/requirements.txt
      - name: 安装依赖
        run: pip install -r requirements.txt
      - name: 运行测试
        run: pytest

  frontend:
    name: 前端构建
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    defaults:
      run:
        working-directory: frontend
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4
        with:
          version: 9
      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: 20
          cache: pnpm
          cache-dependency-path: frontend/pnpm-lock.yaml
      - name: 安装依赖
        run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
      - name: 类型检查 + 构建
        run: pnpm run build
```
